 "notes": [
  "The list has no starting section; the strategy says the deck always starts Watch Your Step and the podracing interrupt (Podrace Prep), and almost always Insurrection & Aim High as the starting effect (Battle Plan & Draw Their Fire against Dark Deal). These count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Tatooine' dested the Coruscant-set Light Tatooine because the strategy says 'In my area, I use the Coruscant version' (he adds that Premiere Tatooine also works).",
  "Posted 'Tatooine Cantina' dested the Light Tatooine: Cantina; 'Millenium Falcon' dested Millennium Falcon; 'Yotts Oren' dested Yotts Orren; 'Run Luke, Run' dested Run Luke, Run!; 'I Did It' dested I Did It!.",
  "Posted combos 'Battle Plan & Draw Their Fire', 'Insurrection & Aim High', 'Your Insight Serves You Well & Staging Areas' and 'All Wings Report In & Darklighter Spin' dested as the Light Coruscant combo cards. The Card Choices section calls the first one 'Battle Plan & First Strike'; the list's Draw Their Fire is kept."
 ],
